     fhir:Narrative.status [ fhir:value "generated" ] ;
     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Genererad berättande text: ConceptMap observation-status-map</b></p><a name=\"observation-status-map\"> </a><a name=\"hcobservation-status-map\"> </a><p>Mappning från <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-snomedct.html\">http://snomed.info/sct</a> till <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-observation-status.html\">http://hl7.org/fhir/observation-status</a></p><br/><p>Mappning från <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-snomedct.html\">SNOMED CT (all versions)</a> to <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-observation-status.html\">ObservationStatus</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Källkod</b></td><td><b>Relation</b></td><td><b>Målkod</b></td><td><b>Kommentar</b></td></tr><tr><td>385676005 (Under utförande)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>preliminary</td><td/></tr><tr><td>385651009 (Slutlig)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>final</td><td/></tr><tr><td>272393004 (Korrigerad)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>amended</td><td/></tr><tr><td>59776000 (Avbeställd/annullerad)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>cancelled</td><td>Avbeställd/annullerad – observationen utfördes aldrig</td></tr><tr><td>444301002 (Avböjd av patient)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-narrower\" title=\"narrower\">narrower</a></td><td>cancelled</td><td>Avböjd av patient – sem